{:edb/db-before-t 1772 :edb/db-after-t 1773 :edb/tx-data [[13194139535085 50 #inst "2026-10-08T16:29:33.603Z" 13194139535085 true] [17592186059490 1100 "The system of equations\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\begin{aligned}6x+4y=1 \\\\ x-8y-z=-2 \\\\ 3x+2y-2z=1\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\ncan be represented using matrix notation as\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14052721/assets/ed434344208758284aa0f144676f7dd6498a63faeb0248d18e87c4be6c3d87f2.png)\n\nWhat are the values of $a,$ $b$ and $c?$" 13194139535085 true] [17592186059490 1100 "The system of equations\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\begin{aligned}6x+4y=1 \\\\ x-8y-z=-2 \\\\ 3x+2y-2z=1\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\ncan be represented using matrix notation as\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}a & 4 & 0 \\\\ 1 & -8 & -1 \\\\ 3 & b & -2\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nWhat are the values of $a,$ $b$ and $c?$" 13194139535085 false] [17592186059490 1145 "First, let's write the system so that $x$, $y$, and $z$ appear in each equation:\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}6x+4y+0z=1 \\\\ x-8y-z=-2 \\\\ 3x+2y-2z=1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we can write the system in the form $A\\mathbf{x} = \\mathbf{b},$ where\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14052721/assets/b9364923447e278db5ec47bef74e1a05310645b30df22d4ea5efcc0de46c6ed2.png)\n\nis the coefficient matrix,\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14052721/assets/16cb1608f70821d138f0c6984038bb42d86d9fbf76d560d94d2e25bd6fdb05e0.png)\n\nis the column vector of constants, and\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14052721/assets/0abbbaf34955fa40d6cdbfa9e16cb1567ee16271d65b4565206a0f2204eedf6d.png)\n\nis the column vector of variables.\n\nSo, the equation $A\\mathbf{x} = \\mathbf{b}$ becomes\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14052721/assets/4b915439c3e9922d692aab4205a728160e0a1286f82fa5ebc736460901581147.png)\n\nTherefore, $a=6,$ $b=2,$ and $c=-2.$" 13194139535085 true] [17592186059490 1145 "First, let's write the system so that $x$, $y$, and $z$ appear in each equation:\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}6x+4y+0z=1 \\\\ x-8y-z=-2 \\\\ 3x+2y-2z=1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we can write the system in the form $A\\mathbf{x} = \\mathbf{b},$ where\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}6 & 4 & 0 \\\\ 1 & -8 & -1 \\\\ 3 & 2 & -2\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nis the coefficient matrix,\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ -2 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nis the column vector of constants, and\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nis the column vector of variables.\n\nSo, the equation $A\\mathbf{x} = \\mathbf{b}$ becomes\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}6 & 4 & 0 \\\\ 1 & -8 & -1 \\\\ 3 & 2 & -2\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nTherefore, $a=6,$ $b=2,$ and $c=-2.$" 13194139535085 false] [17592186059491 1100 "The system of equations\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\begin{aligned}2x-y+z=4 \\\\ z-x+2=-1 \\\\ 2y-2x-4z=-4\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\ncan be represented using matrix notation as\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}2 & -1 & 1 \\\\ -1 & a & 1 \\\\ b & 2 & -4\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nWhat are the values of $a,$ $b$ and $c?$" 13194139535085 false] [17592186059491 1100 "The system of equations\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\begin{aligned}2x-y+z=4 \\\\ z-x+2=-1 \\\\ 2y-2x-4z=-4\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\ncan be represented using matrix notation as\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14052721/assets/0d06481c63a618262b9034124c24cd1d0c566ee9d6b891fa470e09dc67f5f6c6.png)\nWhat are the values of $a,$ $b$ and $c?$" 13194139535085 true] [17592186059491 1145 "First, let's write the system so that $x$, $y$, and $z$ appear in each equation in the correct order and all constants are on the right-hand side of the system:\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}2x-y+z=4 \\\\ -x+0y+z=-3 \\\\ -2x+2y-4z=-4\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we can write the system in the form $A\\mathbf{x} = \\mathbf{b},$ where\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14052721/assets/104c591a6a72cf3caab1bc2a965c57258bb37a31578254696e0c1cd740fe5915.png)\n\nis the coefficient matrix,\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14052721/assets/e008383384401198e67f648cce33a720d98afb6a6f60a14ba7ffa21dcc095a5f.png)\n\nis the column vector of constants, and\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14052721/assets/c85e33202a691b685431ac16efab6a7fd932eac056743df6e81632587f0465b2.png)\n\nis the column vector of variables.\n\nSo, the equation $A\\mathbf{x} = \\mathbf{b}$ becomes\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14052721/assets/64d1f57717dda57c8a7fbc403728ee9699a22ce995f68a50a0b80f25543fdab6.png)\n\nTherefore $a=0,$ $b=-2,$ $c=-3.$" 13194139535085 true] [17592186059491 1145 "First, let's write the system so that $x$, $y$, and $z$ appear in each equation in the correct order and all constants are on the right-hand side of the system:\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}2x-y+z=4 \\\\ -x+0y+z=-3 \\\\ -2x+2y-4z=-4\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we can write the system in the form $A\\mathbf{x} = \\mathbf{b},$ where\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}2 & -1 & 1 \\\\ -1 & 0 & 1 \\\\ -2 & 2 & -4\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nis the coefficient matrix,\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}4 \\\\ -3 \\\\ -4\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nis the column vector of constants, and\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nis the column vector of variables.\n\nSo, the equation $A\\mathbf{x} = \\mathbf{b}$ becomes\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}2 & -1 & 1 \\\\ -1 & 0 & 1 \\\\ -2 & 2 & -4\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nTherefore $a=0,$ $b=-2,$ $c=-3.$" 13194139535085 false] [17592186059682 1020 #edb/ref 17592186330315 13194139535085 true] [17592186059682 1020 #edb/ref 17592186330322 13194139535085 true] [17592186059682 1020 #edb/ref 17592186330336 13194139535085 true] [17592186059683 1020 #edb/ref 17592186330329 13194139535085 true] [17592186059683 1020 #edb/ref 17592186330346 13194139535085 true] [17592186059683 1020 #edb/ref 17592186330353 13194139535085 true] [17592186059683 1020 #edb/ref 17592186330360 13194139535085 true] [17592186059683 1020 #edb/ref 17592186330367 13194139535085 true] [17592186060195 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045463 13194139535085 true] [17592186060195 1100 "The system of equations\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}3x-4y+z=2 \\\\ x-6y+11z=3 \\\\ 3x-4y-z=4\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\ncan be represented using matrix notation as\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}3 & -4 & a \\\\ 1 & b & c \\\\ 3 & -4 & -1\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}2 \\\\ 3 \\\\ 4\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nWhat are the values of $a,b$ and $c?$" 13194139535085 true] [17592186060195 1100 "The system of equations\n${3x - 4y + z = 2; x - 6y + 11z = 3; 3x - 4y - z = 4$\n\ncan be represented using matrix notation as\n$\\begin{bmatrix}3 & -4 & a \\\\ 1 & b & c \\\\ 3 & -4 & -1\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{bmatrix} = \\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ 3 \\\\ 4\\end{bmatrix}$.\n\nWhat are the values of $a, b$ and $c$?" 13194139535085 false] [17592186060195 1145 "We can write the system in the form $Ax=b,$ where\n\n$$\nA=[\\begin{aligned}3 & -4 & 1 \\\\ 1 & -6 & 11 \\\\ 3 & -4 & -1\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nis the coefficient matrix,\n\n$$\nb=[\\begin{aligned}2 \\\\ 3 \\\\ 4\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nis the column vector of constants, and\n\n$$\nx=[\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nis the column vector of variables.\n\nSo, the equation $Ax=b$ becomes\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}3 & -4 & 1 \\\\ 1 & -6 & 11 \\\\ 3 & -4 & -1\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}2 \\\\ 3 \\\\ 4\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nTherefore, $a=1,\\,b=-6,\\,c=11.$" 13194139535085 true] [17592186330315 1017 #edb/ref 17592186330316 13194139535085 true] [17592186330315 1089 "q-130535" 13194139535085 true] [17592186330315 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045463 13194139535085 true] [17592186330315 1100 "The system of equations\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}2x-5y+z=1 \\\\ -x-3y+9z=-2 \\\\ 4x-7y-z=5\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\ncan be represented using matrix notation as\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}2 & -5 & c \\\\ -1 & b & 9 \\\\ a & -7 & -1\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ -2 \\\\ 5\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nWhat are the values of $a,b$ and $c?$" 13194139535085 true] [17592186330315 1113 #uuid "6e2fbe52-d918-52c4-aea4-f6898d19b9a9" 13194139535085 true] [17592186330315 1145 "We can write the system in the form $Ax=b,$ where\n\n$$\nA=[\\begin{aligned}2 & -5 & 1 \\\\ -1 & -3 & 9 \\\\ 4 & -7 & -1\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nis the coefficient matrix,\n\n$$\nb=[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ -2 \\\\ 5\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nis the column vector of constants, and\n\n$$\nx=[\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nis the column vector of variables.\n\nSo, the equation $Ax=b$ becomes\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}2 & -5 & 1 \\\\ 1 & -3 & 9 \\\\ 4 & -7 & -1\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ -2 \\\\ 5\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nTherefore, $a=4,\\,b=-3,\\,c=1.$" 13194139535085 true] [17592186330316 1000 #edb/ref 17592186330317 13194139535085 true] [17592186330316 1000 #edb/ref 17592186330318 13194139535085 true] [17592186330316 1000 #edb/ref 17592186330319 13194139535085 true] [17592186330316 1000 #edb/ref 17592186330320 13194139535085 true] [17592186330316 1000 #edb/ref 17592186330321 13194139535085 true] [17592186330316 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535085 true] [17592186330316 1041 "selection" 13194139535085 true] [17592186330316 1104 #edb/ref 17592186330320 13194139535085 true] [17592186330316 1110 #uuid "d8f1c6a1-1a09-556a-a7fa-a22787f05e4d" 13194139535085 true] [17592186330317 1034 