n$$\nA=[\\begin{aligned}-3 & 1 & 7 \\\\ 1 & -4 & 8 \\\\ 0 & -6 & 9\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nis the coefficient matrix,\n\n$$\nb=[\\begin{aligned}5 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 2\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nis the column vector of constants, and\n\n$$\nx=[\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nis the column vector of variables.\n\nSo, the equation $Ax=b$ becomes\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}-3 & 1 & 7 \\\\ 1 & -4 & 8 \\\\ 0 & -6 & 9\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}5 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 2\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nTherefore, $a=-6,\\,b=8,\\,c=5.$" 13194139535085 true] [17592186330323 1000 #edb/ref 17592186330324 13194139535085 true] [17592186330323 1000 #edb/ref 17592186330325 13194139535085 true] [17592186330323 1000 #edb/ref 17592186330326 13194139535085 true] [17592186330323 1000 #edb/ref 17592186330327 13194139535085 true] [17592186330323 1000 #edb/ref 17592186330328 13194139535085 true] [17592186330323 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535085 true] [17592186330323 1041 "selection" 13194139535085 true] [17592186330323 1104 #edb/ref 17592186330325 13194139535085 true] [17592186330323 1110 #uuid "ddaa1d36-3be6-53f0-83e1-f0abbc7f9daa" 13194139535085 true] [17592186330324 1034 "a=1,\\,b=7,\\,c=8" 13194139535085 true] [17592186330324 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535085 true] [17592186330324 1111 #uuid "4fd6aaf3-2f2b-5b4e-9a66-8e97e1dc63d7" 13194139535085 true] [17592186330325 1034 "a=-6,\\,b=8,\\,c=5" 13194139535085 true] [17592186330325 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535085 true] [17592186330325 1111 #uuid "c8ba4a9f-e65a-5490-ac8f-28df29be2287" 13194139535085 true] [17592186330326 1034 "a=-3,\\,b=1,\\,c=2" 13194139535085 true] [17592186330326 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535085 true] [17592186330326 1111 #uuid "a73157f4-b120-5860-8093-087aee68e1fa" 13194139535085 true] [17592186330327 1034 "a=-4,\\,b=8,\\,c=-3" 13194139535085 true] [17592186330327 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535085 true] [17592186330327 1111 #uuid 